infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title One entry to commit: from 5 disks down to a majority of 3
  desc Replication is broad, but commit narrows to the quorum that makes the entry safe forever
  sequences
    - label 5 nodes receive entry 101
      desc Leader plus 4 followers all get AppendEntries(prevIdx=100, entry 101)
    - label 3 fsync acks needed (majority of 5)
      desc Leader counts its own fsync plus 2 followers — quorum reached before the slow node replies
    - label 1 entry committed, safe forever
      desc A majority has it on disk; no future leader can overwrite it
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #10b981
